Z||000005||sdm1964||10-28-2000||07:13 AM||||I use to work at a car dealer when they first came out. For me too it was love at first sight. When the GT's came out the folling year I knew I had to have one.Thru the years I've almost owned 2 different fieros,But with small kids it seemed inpractical, until last year. 2 of my children are grown up and have moved out.I found an awsome 85 GT in the auto trader after my Camaro was totaled. I didn't buy it new, wished i did. I use to tire of vehicles fast, But i will never part with this car.I am in the process of converting an 86 SE to a fastback. So I guess I will have 2 vehicles that I will never part with!!||||reg||1
